  "review": "Seed-1 independent direct-DFT and existing pinned-PocketFFT checks support the normalization and branch semantics. Cross-backend calibration shows integer quantization differences of at most 1 LSB. FFT3D float maximum is 5.960464477539062e-7. DFTTest maximum 3.814697265625e-6 is four float ULPs at magnitude 9.96 after gain; center/window operations and FFTW versus PocketFFT can accumulate distinct float rounding. Absolute limits 1e-6 and 8e-6 bound this regime with finite headroom and no relative-error allowance. The new scalar/Highway pair remains exact. These limits do not waive systematic scale, border or branch differences, or establish FFT as the exclusive source of all deltas.",
